    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When an enemy you can see within 30 feet of you takes damage and is Bloodied afterward but not killed outright, you can take a Reaction to teleport to an unoccupied space you can see within 5 feet of it. You can then make one melee attack. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-6K1SRbBZxHp7RrPQ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>With Cutthroat (level 17), regain one use when you finish a Short Rest.</p></section>",
